# 038 · Keep lanes off the local network

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.4.0](../roadmap.md#v040)

## What

Under compose, agents' code reaches the internet and the model, and not the local network. Landlock is on where the host allows it. The isolation self-test checks both.

## Why

This removes a known limit of v0.1.0.

## Done when

- [ ] A lane cannot reach a private address under compose, and the self-test fails when it can.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the roadmap.

